## Description

Saying Fable has one-shot me would be a criminal understatemen; it's incredible, and honestly it might be better than I remembered. But if you use it like it's just a smarter Opus, you'll miss the whole point. So here's how I actually work with Fable 5. Showing you how I cut a 5.5-hour agent run from thousands of dollars down to ~$150 by having it orchestrate cheaper models like Codex and GPT-5.5, why you should never push the reasoning slider past high, the CLAUDE.md and skills changes that changed my workflow, and how I got a month of backlog shipped in 3 days!

